## Getting Started

{{if ne .Database "sqlite"}}1. **Start the database:**
   ```bash
   docker compose up -d
   ```

2. {{else}}1. {{end}}**Run migrations:**
   ```bash
   make migrate
   ```

{{if ne .Database "sqlite"}}3.{{else}}2.{{end}} **Run development server with hot-reload:**
   ```bash
   make dev
   ```
   Or without air:
   ```bash
   make run
   ```

{{if ne .Database "sqlite"}}4.{{else}}3.{{end}} **Verify it works:**
   ```bash
   curl http://localhost:8080/health
   ```

## Folder Structure

```
├── cmd/
